OL,3,GNEWSABy-election called after death of
OL,4,Acouncillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA by-election has been called on a
OL,7,Ffinely-balanced Leicestershire council
OL,8,Ffollowing the death of a long-serving
OL,9,Fcouncillor.
OL,11,FVoters will have the chance to elect a
OL,12,Fnew member for the Long Whatton and
OL,13,FDiseworth ward on North West
OL,14,FLeicestershire District Council on
OL,15,FThursday 1 October.
OL,17,FThe seat has been vacant since July,
OL,18,Fwhen Conservative councillor Nick
OL,19,FRushton died after being diagnosed with
OL,20,Fcancer.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,366,360,200,160,0,100
