OL,3,GNEWSABy-election called after death of
OL,4,Acouncillor
OL,5,
OL,6,FRushton had been a member of the
OL,7,Fdistrict council for 35 years while
OL,8,Falso serving for 12 years as leader of
OL,9,FLeicestershire County Council.
